        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Selecting the ideal crown material depends on tooth location, biting load, aesthetic expectations, and opposing enamel contact. Aureva Dental offers biocompatible, clinically proven crown systems:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Monolithic CAD/CAM Zirconia Crowns</h4>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-japandi-moss">₹10,000 – ₹18,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Milled from solid blocks of medical-grade zirconium dioxide, monolithic zirconia offers unmatched fracture resistance (over 1,100 MPa). It is completely metal-free, gentle on opposing enamel when polished, and immune to chipping. Highly recommended for posterior molars where heavy chewing forces occur.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">IPS E-Max Lithium Disilicate Crowns</h4>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-japandi-moss">₹10,000 – ₹18,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              E-max is renowned for lifelike optical translucency, mimicking natural tooth enamel light refraction. Ideal for front teeth (incisors and canines) and premolars visible in your smile line. Biocompatible and bonded adhesive to tooth structure.
            </p>
