            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Porcelain-Fused-to-Metal (PFM) Crowns</h4>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-japandi-moss">₹4,000 – ₹6,000</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              A time-tested restorative solution featuring a durable cast metal framework veneered with tooth-colored porcelain. PFM provides reliable strength for posterior teeth at an accessible fee structure.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- H2 #5: Dental Crown Cost in Hennur Table Section -->
      <div id="pricing" class="space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-japandi-clay/30">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-japandi-moss">Transparent Pricing</span>
